  "key": "f959ddc6",
  "text": "Not too spicy, please."
 },
 {
  "key": "85b74764",
  "text": "Can we get the bill, please?"
 },
 {
  "key": "ffc575e1",
  "text": "Can you pack this for me?"
 },
 {
  "key": "186fe5bb",
  "text": "The service was very good."
 },
 {
  "key": "abe1cfe8",
  "text": "I would like a cup of tea."
 },
 {
  "key": "1128a6c9",
  "text": "Could I have some water?"
 },
 {
  "key": "9054ff27",
  "text": "Good evening. How many people?"
 },
 {
  "key": "afedf531",
  "text": "Here is the menu."
 },
 {
  "key": "b0dbe51b",
  "text": "Our paneer tikka is very popular."
 },
 {
  "key": "817e6400",
  "text": "Okay, I would like one paneer tikka. Not too spicy, please."
 },
 {
  "key": "86decd4c",
  "text": "Sure. Anything to drink?"
 },
 {
  "key": "59ee74bd",
  "text": "Two glasses of buttermilk, please."
 },
 {
  "key": "e98579be",
  "text": "I would like a dosa."
 },
 {
  "key": "5204b743",
  "text": "My phone is not working."
 },
 {
  "key": "7e358541",
  "text": "I lost my wallet."
 },
 {
  "key": "ec18301d",
  "text": "What happened?"
 },
 {
  "key": "b4a548e0",
  "text": "Can you please help me?"
 },
 {
  "key": "7f6093be",
  "text": "Don't worry, it will be okay."
 },
 {
  "key": "d287ae93",
  "text": "I need to charge my phone."
 },
 {
  "key": "e9723286",
  "text": "Please call the police."
 },
 {
  "key": "1262d286",
  "text": "It's an emergency."
 },
 {
  "key": "421236fc",
  "text": "It is raining."
 },
 {
  "key": "eb62f0e1",
  "text": "The fan is not working."
 },
 {
  "key": "b4159329",
  "text": "You look worried. What happened?"
 },
 {
  "key": "64c081e3",
  "text": "I lost my wallet on the bus."
 },
 {
  "key": "98072fd9",
  "text": "Oh no! Was your money in it?"
 },
 {
  "key": "962626d0",
  "text": "Yes, and my ID card too."
 },
 {
  "key": "3fa42630",
  "text": "Don't worry. Let's call the bus office."
 },
 {
  "key": "0c4a10e1",
  "text": "Thank you. You are very kind."
 },
 {
  "key": "28f45c6a",
  "text": "I think it is a good idea."
 },
 {
  "key": "7ed6ea03",
  "text": "I agree with you."
 },
 {
  "key": "083bca6c",
  "text": "I don't agree."
 },
 {
  "key": "032f41ed",
  "text": "In my opinion, it is too late."
 },
 {
  "key": "1b5207f0",
  "text": "That's true."
 },
 {
  "key": "b8516454",
  "text": "I'm not sure."
 },
 {
  "key": "afd05326",
  "text": "Maybe you are right."
 },
 {
  "key": "2e87dc8c",
  "text": "What do you think?"
 },
 {
  "key": "cfa0ca20",
  "text": "I think she is at home."
 },
 {
  "key": "122c7496",
  "text": "I don't think it is expensive."
 },
 {
  "key": "10b21022",
  "text": "Let's go to the new mall on Saturday."
 },
 {
  "key": "f8494b76",
  "text": "I think it will be very crowded."
 },
 {
  "key": "6734c040",
  "text": "Maybe you are right. What do you think about the lake?"
 },
 {
  "key": "3884a396",
  "text": "That's a good idea. It is quiet and beautiful."
 },
 {
  "key": "5d03a283",
  "text": "I agree. Let's go in the evening."
 },
 {
  "key": "8199ab2e",
  "text": "Perfect. See you on Saturday."
 },
 {
  "key": "67864094",
  "text": "Tell me about yourself."
 },
 {
  "key": "ae2973e3",
  "text": "I have three years of experience."
 },
 {
  "key": "c45f7873",
  "text": "My biggest strength is hard work."
 },
 {
  "key": "ab9ade67",
  "text": "I am a quick learner."
 },
 {
  "key": "83337a05",
  "text": "I enjoy working in a team."
 },
 {
  "key": "36b68eed",
  "text": "Why do you want this job?"
 },
 {
  "key": "ae94e3bd",
  "text": "I want to grow in my career."
 },
 {
  "key": "08390259",
  "text": "When can you join?"
 },
 {
  "key": "bca70313",
  "text": "I studied commerce in college."
 },
 {
  "key": "aeceddca",
  "text": "I am looking for a new challenge."
 },
 {
  "key": "0e4a577c",
  "text": "Good morning. Please have a seat."
 },
 {
  "key": "fa18b162",
  "text": "Thank you."
 },
 {
  "key": "a32daebd",
  "text": "I studied commerce, and I have three years of experience in sales."
 },
 {
  "key": "9b91cffb",
  "text": "What is your biggest strength?"
 },
 {
  "key": "dcd32070",
  "text": "I am a quick learner, and I enjoy working in a team."
 },
 {
  "key": "24aefba8",
  "text": "Very good. When can you join?"
 },
 {
  "key": "6f4bea34",
  "text": "I can join in two weeks."
 },
 {
  "key": "9e50876f",
  "text": "Could you please help me with this?"
 },
 {
  "key": "d4931622",
  "text": "Would you mind closing the window?"
 },
 {
  "key": "6bb9e4db",
  "text": "May I come in?"
 },
 {
  "key": "2324f168",
  "text": "I'm afraid I can't come today."
 },
 {
  "key": "f7042881",
  "text": "I apologize for the delay."
 },
 {
  "key": "ae0bbdb5",
  "text": "Thank you for your patience."
 },
 {
  "key": "06b926d3",
  "text": "Please let me know if you need anything."
 },
 {
  "key": "85ebf00e",
  "text": "I would really appreciate your help."
 },
 {
  "key": "afecb02d",
  "text": "Would you mind waiting for five minutes?"
 },
 {
  "key": "c17a695b",
  "text": "No, not at all."
 },
 {
  "key": "a4ccebf3",
  "text": "Hello, I ordered a fridge last week, but it hasn't arrived."
 },
 {
  "key": "7460155d",
  "text": "I apologize for the delay. Could you please tell me your order number?"
 },
 {
  "key": "8b21817c",
  "text": "Yes, it is four five six seven."
 },
 {
  "key": "c255a34a",
  "text": "Thank you. Would you mind waiting for a moment?"
 },
 {
  "key": "338f3599",
  "text": "Thank you for your patience. Your fridge will arrive tomorrow."
 },
 {
  "key": "51ec17d3",
  "text": "Have you ever been to Goa?"
 },
 {
  "key": "2c0ca3d4",
  "text": "I have never seen snow."
 },
 {
  "key": "5cb7530d",
  "text": "I have lived here for five years."
 },
 {
  "key": "c9595511",
  "text": "I have just finished my work."
 },
 {
  "key": "e65327b8",
  "text": "She has already left."
 },
 {
  "key": "718d648d",
  "text": "We have known each other since school."
 },
 {
  "key": "48f8f961",
  "text": "How long have you worked here?"
 },
 {
  "key": "90d66739",
  "text": "I haven't decided yet."
 },
 {
  "key": "f19027bc",
  "text": "I have worked here since 2019."
 },
 {
  "key": "3961c787",
  "text": "She has waited for an hour."
 },
 {
  "key": "7c677567",
  "text": "Have you ever been to Kashmir?"
 },
 {
  "key": "d309cbd7",
  "text": "No, I have never been there. Have you?"
 },
 {
  "key": "7d147455",
  "text": "Yes, I have been there twice."
 },
 {
  "key": "220ca22f",
  "text": "Wow! Have you seen snow?"
 },
 {
  "key": "5bfb1017",
  "text": "Yes, it was amazing. You should go in winter."
 },
 {
  "key": "2a12174d",
  "text": "I haven't decided yet, but I will think about it."
 },
 {
  "key": "cbd74940",
  "text": "If it rains, I will stay at home."
 },
 {
  "key": "8e37eca1",
  "text": "If you study hard, you will pass."
 },
 {
  "key": "8738fb9e",
  "text": "If I had more money, I would buy a car."
 },
 {
  "key": "aac554f6",
  "text": "If I were you, I would talk to him."
 },
 {
  "key": "0d3c12c9",
  "text": "What would you do if you won the lottery?"
 },
 {
  "key": "1ac621ab",
  "text": "I would travel around the world."
 },
 {
  "key": "6bd2aa5e",
  "text": "Unless you hurry, you will miss the bus."
 },
 {
  "key": "b89e11d5",
  "text": "If I had known, I would have come."
 },
 {
  "key": "997b6017",
  "text": "If I had wings, I would fly."
 },
 {
  "key": "692f9840",
  "text": "If you call me, I will come."
 },
 {
  "key": "2b9f7d5a",
  "text": "I would buy a house for my parents."
 },
 {
  "key": "a4fd6860",
  "text": "That's sweet. Anything else?"
 },
 {
  "key": "6ede86c0",
  "text": "If I had more time, I would travel around the world."
 },
 {
  "key": "d88a2690",
  "text": "If you save money every month, you can travel next year."
 },
 {
  "key": "c7c67990",
  "text": "You are right. I will start saving today."
 },
 {
  "key": "77781e67",
  "text": "If I had money, I would buy a car."
 },
 {
  "key": "6fcfd0d6",
  "text": "This test was a piece of cake."
 },
 {
  "key": "96b2f361",
  "text": "I'm feeling under the weather."
 },
 {
  "key": "fd8e9576",
  "text": "He visits us once in a blue moon."
 },
 {
  "key": "c556a208",
  "text": "Better late than never."
 },
 {
  "key": "f64adb1a",
  "text": "Let's call it a day."
 },
 {
  "key": "3fe76807",
  "text": "Take it easy."
 },
 {
  "key": "fb54ce6f",
  "text": "It's up to you."
 },
 {
  "key": "a0cc24ef",
  "text": "I'll keep my fingers crossed."
 },
 {
  "key": "5a663556",
  "text": "Break a leg!"
 },
 {
  "key": "9c2bcc22",
  "text": "Don't worry, it's not rocket science."
 },
 {
  "key": "b5430d53",
  "text": "How was your exam?"
 },
 {
  "key": "4e5b227a",
  "text": "It was a piece of cake!"
 },
 {
  "key": "75e1af5c",
  "text": "Great! When is the result?"
 },
 {
  "key": "d827bf4e",
  "text": "Next week. I'll keep my fingers crossed."
 },
 {
  "key": "10008981",
  "text": "Let's celebrate tonight. Pizza or Gujarati thali?"
 },
 {
  "key": "0dbcdf4e",
  "text": "It's up to you. I'm happy with anything."
 },
 {
  "key": "f4ed3ca3",
  "text": "The test was a piece of cake."
 },
 {
  "key": "748b0aa5",
  "text": "He comes once in a blue moon."
 },
 {
  "key": "76fbfb5c",
  "text": "First of all, thank you for coming."
 },
 {
  "key": "382dd8df",
  "text": "The main reason is the high cost."
 },
 {
  "key": "ca5fd35e",
  "text": "For example, petrol prices have gone up."
 },
 {
  "key": "789c4130",
  "text": "On the other hand, it saves time."
 },
 {
  "key": "37026808",
  "text": "That's why I prefer the train."
 },
 {
  "key": "7d236129",
  "text": "As a result, we saved a lot of money."
 },
 {
  "key": "a6710415",
  "text": "Let me explain my point."
 },
 {
  "key": "4e01235f",
  "text": "In conclusion, both options are good."
 },
 {
  "key": "8c6159e8",
  "text": "However, the bus is cheaper."
 },
 {
  "key": "7a72b738",
  "text": "Also, it is safe."
 },
 {
  "key": "af6f8824",
  "text": "Should we go to Mumbai by car or by train?"
 },
 {
  "key": "ab859e07",
  "text": "I prefer the train. The main reason is the cost."
 },
 {
  "key": "ee35e77c",
  "text": "But by car we can stop anywhere."
 },
 {
  "key": "968ae4bc",
  "text": "That's true. On the other hand, driving for eight hours is tiring."
 },
 {
  "key": "140aca0e",
  "text": "Okay, let me think."
 },
 {
  "key": "8e62b705",
  "text": "Also, we can sleep on the train. That's why it is better."
 }
]
